# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit .env.local itself.

# --- P5.1: scoreboard API (apps/server/src/scoreboard-api) ---

# Base URL of the VPS-hosted scoreboard API (task P0.11's VPS, task P5.1's service). Deliberately
# WITHOUT the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix — this must never ship to the browser bundle. Only
# apps/web/src/app/api/scoreboard/route.ts (a server-side Route Handler) reads it.
# This is the VPS's public IP:port — no domain exists yet for Tinjau, so this is a bare
# IP:port, plain HTTP (the service has no TLS; it's consumed server-side only, never
# directly from a browser).
SCOREBOARD_API_URL=http://15.235.146.33:8787
